    "speech_transmission_html": "<h3>Speech Transmission Index — Left</h3><p class=\"epa-footer\">STI unavailable: requires a native measured room impulse response covering all seven octaves (125 Hz–8 kHz), with usable band energy and its complete decay. Synthesized EQ impulses do not supply this result.</p>",
    "optimization_waterfall_html": "<h3>Measured room IR waterfall and resonance decay</h3><p>Pre-correction measured response</p><p>Supported band: 80–20000 Hz. The grid is referenced to its own full-grid peak; colors and levels do not compare absolute output between channels.</p><h4>Pre-correction</h4><div class=\"report-figure\" data-section=\"{&quot;kind&quot;: &quot;grid&quot;, &quot;figure&quot;: {&quot;title&quot;: &quot;Measured room IR waterfall&quot;, &quot;x&quot;: {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;Frequency (Hz)&quot;, &quot;scale&quot;: &quot;log&quot;, &quot;min&quot;: 100, &quot;max&quot;: 10000}, &quot;y&quot;: {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;Time from broadband peak (ms)&quot;, &quot;scale&quot;: &quot;linear&quot;, &quot;min&quot;: 0, &quot;max&quot;: 20}, &quot;y2&quot;: null, &quot;series&quot;: [{&quot;name&quot;: &quot;1000.0 Hz&quot;, &quot;x&quot;: [], &quot;y&quot;: [], &quot;color&quot;: &quot;#cc47cc&quot;, &quot;width&quot;: 2.0, &quot;dash&quot;: &quot;solid&quot;, &quot;visible&quot;: true, &quot;y_axis&quot;: 0}, {&quot;name&quot;: &quot;10000.0 Hz&quot;, &quot;x&quot;: [], &quot;y&quot;: [], &quot;color&quot;: &quot;#cc47cc&quot;, &quot;width&quot;: 2.0, &quot;dash&quot;: &quot;solid&quot;, &quot;visible&quot;: true, &quot;y_axis&quot;: 0}], &quot;hlines&quot;: [], &quot;vlines&quot;: [], &quot;xranges&quot;: [], &quot;annotations&quot;: [], &quot;legend&quot;: true}, &quot;tab&quot;: null, &quot;grid&quot;: {&quot;x&quot;: [100, 1000, 10000], &quot;y&quot;: [0, 10, 20], &quot;z&quot;: [[0, -10, -20], [-20, -30, -40], [-40, -50, -60]], &quot;surface&quot;: true, &quot;zmin&quot;: -60, &quot;zmax&quot;: 0, &quot;highlights&quot;: [1, 2], &quot;colormap&quot;: &quot;turbo&quot;, &quot;show_surface&quot;: false, &quot;show_contours&quot;: true}}\"></div><table><caption>Detected 60 ms peaks and fitted 20–200 ms decay</caption><tr><th>Frequency (Hz)</th><th>Level (dB re own grid peak)</th><th>Fitted decay (s)</th></tr><tr><td>1e+03</td><td>-8.50</td><td>0.42</td></tr><tr><td>1e+04</td><td>-20.00</td><td>unavailable</td></tr></table><p>Highlighted: up to two longest fitted decays, then strongest 60 ms peak. Curves retain the full-grid peak reference; no fitted intercept is exported, so no extrapolated fit line is invented.</p><div class=\"report-figure\" data-section=\"{&quot;kind&quot;: &quot;figure&quot;, &quot;figure&quot;: {&quot;title&quot;: &quot;Pre-correction: decay of highlighted resonances&quot;, &quot;x&quot;: {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;Time from broadband peak (ms)&quot;, &quot;scale&quot;: &quot;linear&quot;, &quot;min&quot;: 0, &quot;max&quot;: 500}, &quot;y&quot;: {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;Level relative to full grid peak (dB)&quot;, &quot;scale&quot;: &quot;linear&quot;, &quot;min&quot;: -60, &quot;max&quot;: 0}, &quot;y2&quot;: null, &quot;series&quot;: [{&quot;name&quot;: &quot;1000.0 Hz — T60 0.420 s&quot;, &quot;x&quot;: [0.0, 10.0, 20.0], &quot;y&quot;: [-10.0, -30.0, -50.0], &quot;color&quot;: &quot;#cc47cc&quot;, &quot;width&quot;: 2.0, &quot;dash&quot;: &quot;solid&quot;, &quot;visible&quot;: true, &quot;y_axis&quot;: 0}, {&quot;name&quot;: &quot;10000.0 Hz&quot;, &quot;x&quot;: [0.0, 10.0, 20.0], &quot;y&quot;: [-20.0, -40.0, -60.0], &quot;color&quot;: &quot;#cc47cc&quot;, &quot;width&quot;: 2.0, &quot;dash&quot;: &quot;solid&quot;, &quot;visible&quot;: true, &quot;y_axis&quot;: 0}], &quot;hlines&quot;: [], &quot;vlines&quot;: [], &quot;xranges&quot;: [], &quot;annotations&quot;: [], &quot;legend&quot;: true}, &quot;tab&quot;: null}\"></div>",
    "optimization_wavelet_html": "<h3>Measured room IR three-cycle wavelet</h3><p>Blue = −30 dB, red = 0 dB relative to the channel’s own full wavelet-grid peak. Colors do not compare absolute output levels.</p><p>Frequency runs left to right; time runs upward. Dense exports use 0.1 ms early-time sampling through 15 ms and 1 ms later sampling; the recorded time coordinates remain authoritative.</p><p>Three-cycle wavelet; first 15 ms (3 exported time samples). Log-frequency x-axis, time y-axis. Colours retain the full-grid peak reference. The cyan dashed ridge marks peak energy arrival time per frequency. Display cells reflect the exported sampling; zoom cannot restore omitted samples.</p><div class=\"report-figure\" data-section=\"{&quot;kind&quot;: &quot;grid&quot;, &quot;figure&quot;: {&quot;title&quot;: &quot;Measured room IR three-cycle wavelet heatmap&quot;, &quot;x&quot;: {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;Frequency (Hz)&quot;, &quot;scale&quot;: &quot;log&quot;, &quot;min&quot;: 100, &quot;max&quot;: 10000}, &quot;y&quot;: {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;Time from broadband peak (ms)&quot;, &quot;scale&quot;: &quot;linear&quot;, &quot;min&quot;: 0, &quot;max&quot;: 4}, &quot;y2&quot;: null, &quot;series&quot;: [], &quot;hlines&quot;: [], &quot;vlines&quot;: [], &quot;xranges&quot;: [], &quot;annotations&quot;: [], &quot;legend&quot;: true}, &quot;tab&quot;: null, &quot;grid&quot;: {&quot;x&quot;: [100, 1000, 10000], &quot;y&quot;: [0, 2, 4], &quot;z&quot;: [[0, -8, -20], [-1, -9, -25], [-4, -10, -30]], &quot;surface&quot;: false, &quot;zmin&quot;: -30, &quot;zmax&quot;: 0, &quot;highlights&quot;: []}}\"></div>"
